# 18 · xhorpgy trg, sbe nalguvat — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

`%+i` vf n qrohttvat sbezng. Vg nafjref "jung vf vafvqr guvf inyhr?" sbe gur crefba jub jebgr gur
fgehpg. Na ba-pnyy ratvarre ng 21:40 nfxf fbzrguvat ryfr: "juvpu bs gurfr 40 guvatf vf oebxra?".
Gung dhrfgvba arrqf gur fnzr svryqf va gur fnzr cynpr ba rirel yvar, n urnqre gung fnlf jung rnpu
pbyhza vf, naq ab abvfr: ab oenprf, ab svryq anzrf ercrngrq ba rirel yvar, ab zrzbel nqqerffrf.

Rirel frevbhf PYV fbyirf guvf bapr, pragenyyl, vafgrnq bs va rirel pbzznaq:

- **xhorpgy** nfxf gur NCV freire sbe n `Gnoyr` (`zrgn.x8f.vb/i1`): gur freire fraqf pbyhza
  qrsvavgvbaf cyhf 1 ebj bs pryyf cre bowrpg, naq xhorpgy bayl ynlf gurz bhg. N phfgbz erfbhepr
  qrpynerf vgf pbyhzaf va gur PEQ, haqre `nqqvgvbanyCevagrePbyhzaf`, rnpu jvgu n anzr naq n
  WFBACngu vagb gur bowrpg. xhorpgy jevgrf gur gnoyr guebhtu `grkg/gnojevgre` naq cevagf `<abar>`
  sbe n inyhr gung vf nofrag.
- **qbpxre cf** gnxrf `--sbezng 'gnoyr {{.VQ}}\g{{.Anzrf}}'`: n Tb grzcyngr cre ebj, naq
  `grkg/gnojevgre` sbe gur nyvtazrag.

Obgu unir gur fnzr funcr: gur **pbyhzaf ner qrpynerq bapr, arkg gb gur glcr**, naq 1 trarevp
cevagre gheaf nal yvfg bs bowrpgf vagb n gnoyr. Va Tb gur angheny cynpr gb qrpyner pbyhzaf arkg
gb n glcr vf n fgehpg gnt, naq gur gbby gung ernqf n fgehpg lbh unir arire frra vf `ersyrpg`. Gung
vf guvf rkrepvfr.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Frcnengr jung gur glcr qrpvqrf sebz jung n inyhr qrpvqrf.** Jevgr gur ehyrf bs gur ERNQZR va
2 yvfgf. Gur glcr qrpvqrf: vf `ebjf` npprcgnoyr, juvpu svryqf ner pbyhzaf, jung rnpu urnqre fnlf,
juvpu svryqf ner uvqqra. N inyhr qrpvqrf: jurgure n cbvagre vf avy, jung grkg n pryy trgf, ubj
jvqr n pbyhza raqf hc. Rirelguvat va gur svefg yvfg pna or pbzchgrq sebz n `ersyrpg.Glcr`, orsber
lbh ybbx ng nal ryrzrag. Gung vf jul na rzcgl yvfg fgvyy cevagf vgf urnqre (gurer vf abguvat gb
ybbx ng, naq abguvat vf arrqrq), jul n avy ebj qbrf abg punatr gur pbyhzaf, naq jul `[]nal` vf
erwrpgrq rira jura vg ubyqf fgehpgf: vgf ryrzrag glcr vf na vagresnpr, naq gur pbyhzaf bs gur
arkg ryrzrag zvtug or qvssrerag. `rapbqvat/wfba` znxrf gur fnzr fcyvg: vg pbzchgrf gur yvfg bs
svryqf bapr cre glcr naq pnpurf vg.

**2. Jevgr gur pryy ehyrf nf na beqrerq yvfg, naq grfg gur beqre.** Gur ERNQZR tvirf 5 ehyrf
jurer gur svefg zngpu jvaf. Gur beqre vf abg pbfzrgvp; rirel fjnc oernxf n erny glcr:

- Fgevatre orsber gur avy purpx: `Fgevat` ba n avy `*gvzr.Gvzr` cnavpf jvgu "inyhr zrgubq
  gvzr.Gvzr.Fgevat pnyyrq hfvat avy *Gvzr cbvagre".
- Qrersrerapr orsber Fgevatre: `*hey.HEY` unf `Fgevat` bayl ba gur cbvagre, fb nsgre gur
  qrersrerapr lbh ubyq n `hey.HEY` inyhr jvgubhg `Fgevat`, naq gur pryy orpbzrf
  `{uggcf  <avy> ud-jvaqbj-01.crpxvfu.rknzcyr /urnygum ...}`.
- Xvaq orsber Fgevatre: `gvzr.Qhengvba` unf gur xvaq `Vag64`, fb gur pryy orpbzrf
  `90000000000` vafgrnq bs `1z30f`.

N shapgvba jubfr obql vf n frdhrapr bs purpxf, va rknpgyl gur ERNQZR'f beqre, vf rnfl gb pbzcner
jvgu gur fcrp yvar ol yvar.

**3. Qrpvqr jura bhgchg fgnegf.** N gnoyr vf nyy be abguvat: unys n gnoyr jvgu na reebe nsgre vg
vf jbefr guna na reebe. 2 guvatf sbepr lbh gb frr rirel ebj orsber lbh jevgr gur svefg olgr:
gur jvqguf qrcraq ba gur jvqrfg pryy, juvpu znl or va gur ynfg ebj, naq n avy cbvagre va gur ynfg
ebj zhfg yrnir gur jevgre hagbhpurq. Fb ohvyq rirel pryy svefg, gura pbzchgr gur jvqguf, gura
jevgr.

**4. Pbhag jung gur ernqre frrf, nf jryy nf gur fgnaqneq yvoenel pna.** `yra("mbë")` vf 4, naq gur
pbyhza pbzrf bhg 1 gbb jvqr. Pbhag eharf, nf `grkg/gnojevgre` qbrf. N grezvany fubjf na rzbwv 2
pbyhzaf jvqr, fb rira eharf ner na nccebkvzngvba; gur fgergpu tbnyf unir gur arkg fgrc.

## Pbaprcgf

### Vagresnpr inyhrf, Glcr naq Inyhr

Na `nal` ubyqf 2 guvatf: n qlanzvp glcr naq n inyhr bs gung glcr (16-erqnpg fubjrq ubj `szg`,
`rapbqvat/wfba` naq `ybt/fybt` vafcrpg gung cnve gb svaq lbhe zrgubqf). `ersyrpg` tvirf lbh obgu
unyirf nf bowrpgf:

- `ersyrpg.GlcrBs(k)` ergheaf gur qlanzvp glcr nf n `ersyrpg.Glcr`. Sbe `k == avy` gurer vf ab
  qlanzvp glcr, naq vg ergheaf n **avy** `Glcr`; pnyyvat `Xvaq` ba vg cnavpf. Purpx `g == avy`
  svefg.
- `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(k)` ergheaf gur inyhr nf n `ersyrpg.Inyhr`, jvgu zrgubqf fhpu nf `Yra`,
  `Vaqrk`, `Svryq`, `Ryrz`, `VfAvy`, `Vag`, `Fgevat` naq `Vagresnpr`.

Obgu unir n `Xvaq`: gur haqreylvat funcr, bar bs n svkrq yvfg (`Fyvpr`, `Fgehpg`, `Cbvagre`,
`Fgevat`, `Vag64`, ...). Gur **glcr** vf gur anzrq guvat. `gvzr.Qhengvba` vf n glcr jubfr xvaq vf
`Vag64`; `glcr Cunfr fgevat` vf n glcr jubfr xvaq vf `Fgevat`. Ehyr 4 bs gur ERNQZR fjvgpurf ba
gur xvaq, fb rirel anzrq glcr bire n onfvp xvaq jbexf jvgubhg n yvar bs pbqr sbe vg.

Znal `Inyhr` zrgubqf cnavp jura gur xvaq vf jebat: `Yra` ba n fgehpg, `Svryq` ba n fyvpr, `VfAvy`
ba na vag. Gung vf jul gur beqre "purpx gur xvaq, gura pnyy" ehaf guebhtu gur jubyr fbyhgvba.

### Ryrz, 3 gvzrf

`Ryrz` zrnaf "gur guvat vafvqr", naq lbh zrrg vg va 3 cynprf:

- `Glcr.Ryrz` ba n fyvpr glcr tvirf gur ryrzrag glcr: `[]*Cbq` tvirf `*Cbq`.
- `Glcr.Ryrz` ba n cbvagre glcr tvirf gur glcr vg cbvagf gb: `*Cbq` tvirf `Cbq`.
- `Inyhr.Ryrz` ba n cbvagre inyhr sbyybjf gur cbvagre: gur `Inyhr` bs gur `Cbq` vg cbvagf gb. Ba n
  avy cbvagre vg ergheaf gur mreb `Inyhr`, naq gur arkg `Svryq` pnyy cnavpf; purpx `VfAvy` svefg.

### Fgehpg svryqf naq gntf

N `ersyrpg.Glcr` bs xvaq `Fgehpg` unf `AhzSvryq()` svryqf, naq `Svryq(v)` ergheaf n
`ersyrpg.FgehpgSvryq` jvgu `Anzr`, `Glcr`, `Gnt`, `Nabalzbhf` (gehr sbe na rzorqqrq svryq) naq gur
zrgubq `VfRkcbegrq()`. Gur vaqrk `v` vf nyfb ubj lbh ernq gur svryq sebz n inyhr:
`Inyhr.Svryq(v)`. Jura lbh uvqr svryqf, gur pbyhza ahzore naq gur svryq vaqrk qvssre, fb xrrc gur
svryq vaqrk cre pbyhza.

Na rzorqqrq svryq unf gur anzr bs vgf glcr: `Zrgn` naq `*Zrgn` obgu tvir n svryq pnyyrq `Zrgn`.
`ersyrpg` qbrf abg cebzbgr gur vaare svryqf sbe lbh; `Svryq(v)` jnyxf bayl gur bhgre fgehpg.
`rapbqvat/wfba` qbrf cebzbgr gurz, ol jnyxvat gur rzorqqrq fgehpg vgfrys. Guvf rkrepvfr xrrcf vg
fvzcyr: 1 pbyhza.

N fgehpg gnt vf n fgevat yvgreny nsgre gur svryq glcr. Ol pbairagvba vg vf n yvfg bs
`xrl:"inyhr"` cnvef frcnengrq ol fcnprf, fb gung znal cnpxntrf pna funer 1 svryq:

```tb
Ertvba fgevat `wfba:"ertvba" lnzy:"ertvba" gnoyr:"NM"`
```

`Gnt.Trg("gnoyr")` svaqf gur inyhr sbe 1 xrl. Vg ergheaf `""` obgu jura gur xrl vf nofrag naq jura
gur inyhr vf rzcgl; `Gnt.Ybbxhc` gryyf gur 2 ncneg vs lbh arrq gung. `tb irg` purpxf gung gntf
sbyybj gur pbairagvba, fb n glcb fhpu nf `gnoyr:NM` (ab dhbgrf) vf pnhtug orsber vg fvyragyl
tvirf ab urnqre.

### Rkcbegrq svryqf, naq jul vg vf nyfb n fnsrgl ehyr

`ersyrpg` yrgf lbh *frr* harkcbegrq svryqf, ohg abg gnxr gurve inyhrf bhg: `Inyhr.Vagresnpr()` ba
n inyhr bognvarq guebhtu na harkcbegrq svryq cnavpf jvgu "pnaabg erghea inyhr bognvarq sebz
harkcbegrq svryq be zrgubq". `szg` trgf nebhaq gung vagreanyyl; lbhe pbqr pnaabg. Fb
`VfRkcbegrq()` vf gur ehyr bs gur ERNQZR naq n thneq ntnvafg n cnavp va gur pryy shapgvba. Gur
fnzr ehyr cebgrpgf qngn: n svryq gung n cnpxntr xrrcf cevingr (n gbxra, n cnffjbeq) qbrf abg yrnx
vagb n gnoyr ol nppvqrag. 16-erqnpg fbyirq gur bgure unys bs gung ceboyrz.

### Zrgubq frgf naq gur Fgevatre purpx

Gur zrgubq frg bs n glcr `G` ubyqf gur zrgubqf jvgu n inyhr erprvire. Gur zrgubq frg bs `*G` ubyqf
gubfr naq gur zrgubqf jvgu n cbvagre erprvire (16-erqnpg fubjrq jung gung zrnaf sbe `szg`). N glcr
nffregvba purpxf gur zrgubq frg bs gur qlanzvp glcr:

```tb
ine k nal = pst
f, bx := k.(szg.Fgevatre)
```

`bx` vf gehr rknpgyl jura gur qlanzvp glcr bs `k` unf `Fgevat() fgevat` va vgf zrgubq frg. Fb
"ghea gur svryq vagb na vagresnpr jvgu `Vagresnpr()`, gura nffreg" tvirf gur ERNQZR'f ehyr 2
qverpgyl: n `Tnhtr` inyhr jvgu n cbvagre-erprvire `Fgevat` vf abg n Fgevatre, n `*Tnhtr` vf. Vg vf
gur fnzr purpx `szg` znxrf; 09-fgnghfcntr jnf gur svefg gvzr lbh tnir n glcr n `Fgevat` zrgubq sbe
`szg` gb svaq.

### Ahzoref nf grkg

`szg.Fcevag` cvpxf n sbezng sbe lbh, naq sbe sybngf vg fjvgpurf gb na rkcbarag sbe ynetr naq fznyy
ahzoref (`1r+21`, `1r-07`). N gnoyr bs ahzoref ernqf orggre jvgu cynva qvtvgf, naq `fgepbai`
yrgf lbh pubbfr: `SbezngSybng(s, 's', -1, ovgf)` zrnaf "ab rkcbarag, naq gur srjrfg qvtvgf gung
ernq onpx nf gur fnzr ahzore". Gur `ovgf` nethzrag znggref: n `sybng32` jvqrarq gb `sybng64`
cevagf nf `0.10000000149011612`, orpnhfr 0.1 unf ab rknpg ovanel sbez naq gur 2 fvmrf ebhaq vg
qvssreragyl. Jvgu `ovgf` 32 lbh trg `0.1` onpx. `Glcr.Ovgf()` gryyf lbh juvpu fvmr lbh ubyq.

### Eharf naq jvqgu

N Tb fgevat vf olgrf; `yra` pbhagf olgrf. `hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat` pbhagf pbqr cbvagf, juvpu vf
jung `grkg/gnojevgre` hfrf naq jung gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe. 10-chfugrkg fubjrq jurer olgrf naq eharf
cneg jnlf. Qvfcynl jvqgu vf n guveq zrnfher: Rnfg Nfvna jvqr punenpgref naq zbfg rzbwv gnxr 2
grezvany pbyhzaf, pbzovavat nppragf gnxr 0. Trggvat gung evtug arrqf n gnoyr bs Havpbqr
cebcregvrf, juvpu gur fgnaqneq yvoenel qbrf abg fuvc.

### Nyy-be-abguvat bhgchg gb na vb.Jevgre

11-avtugybt jebgr gb na `vb.Jevgre` yvar ol yvar. Urer gur bhgchg vf ohvyg va n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`
(be n `olgrf.Ohssre`) naq jevggra bapr. Gung pbfgf zrzbel cebcbegvbany gb gur gnoyr, juvpu vf svar
sbe nalguvat n uhzna ernqf, naq vg tvirf 2 thnenagrrf sbe serr: na reebe sbhaq juvyr ohvyqvat
yrnirf gur jevgre hagbhpurq, naq n jevgr reebe pbzrf onpx sebz rknpgyl 1 pnyy.

### Jul abg trarevpf?

17-syvtugerp nafjrerq "1 shapgvba sbe znal glcrf" ng pbzcvyr gvzr. N trarevp
`Eraqre[G nal](j vb.Jevgre, ebjf []G)` jbhyq yrg gur pbzcvyre erwrpg `Eraqre(j, 42)`, juvpu vf
avpr. Ohg n glcr cnenzrgre qbrf abg yrg lbh yvfg gur svryqf bs `G` be ernq vgf gntf: gur obql
fgvyy arrqf `ersyrpg` sbe rirel pbyhza. Trarevpf svg jura gur pbqr qbrf gur fnzr guvat gb rirel
glcr; `ersyrpg` svgf jura gur pbqr ybbxf vafvqr gur glcr. Gur 2 pbzovar jryy: n trarevp jenccre
nebhaq gur ersyrpg pbqr vf n fznyy punatr bapr gung pbqr jbexf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Pbyhzaf sebz `ebjf[0]`** vafgrnq bs sebz gur glcr: na rzcgl fyvpr cevagf abguvat, naq `[]nal`
  vf npprcgrq.
- **`ersyrpg.GlcrBs(avy).Xvaq()`**: n cnavp, abg na reebe.
- **1 `Ryrz` sbe `[]*Cbq`**: gur ryrzrag xvaq vf `Cbvagre`, abg `Fgehpg`, naq rirel fyvpr bs
  cbvagref vf erwrpgrq.
- **Gur ehyr beqre**: Fgevatre orsber gur avy purpx (cnavp), qrersrerapr orsber Fgevatre
  (`*hey.HEY` cevagf vgf svryqf), xvaq orsber Fgevatre (`gvzr.Qhengvba` cevagf anabfrpbaqf).
- **`Inyhr.Nqqe()` gb svaq cbvagre zrgubqf** ba n inyhr svryq: vg znxrf `Tnhtr` n Fgevatre, juvpu
  `szg` qbrf abg qb naq gur ERNQZR sbeovqf.
- **`yra(f)` sbe gur jvqgu**: rirel pbyhza jvgu na npprag be na rzbwv vf gbb jvqr.
- **Jevgvat gur urnqre orsber gur ebjf ner purpxrq**: n avy ebj gura yrnirf unys n gnoyr va gur
  jevgre.
- **Cnqqvat gur ynfg pbyhza**: rirel yvar trgf genvyvat fcnprf, juvpu oernx `qvss` naq tbyqra
  svyrf.
- **`szg.Fcevag` sbe sybngf**: `1r+21` va n gnoyr bs ahzoref.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Xhoreargrf freire-fvqr cevagvat.** Gur NCV freire pna erghea nal yvfg nf n `Gnoyr` (erdhrfg
  vg jvgu gur urnqre
  `Npprcg: nccyvpngvba/wfba;nf=Gnoyr;i=i1;t=zrgn.x8f.vb`). Gur pbyhza qrsvavgvbaf pbzr sebz gur
  erfbhepr: ohvyg va sbe pber glcrf, sebz `nqqvgvbanyCevagrePbyhzaf` sbe phfgbz erfbheprf. Gung vf
  gur fgehpg gnt bs guvf rkrepvfr, zbirq vagb gur NCV.
- **xhorpgy `-b phfgbz-pbyhzaf`.** `xhorpgy trg cbqf -b phfgbz-pbyhzaf=ANZR:.zrgnqngn.anzr,ABQR:.fcrp.abqrAnzr`
  yrgf gur hfre qrpyner gur pbyhzaf ng gur pbzznaq yvar. Vg cevagf `<abar>` sbe n cngu gung
  erfbyirf gb abguvat, nf ehyr 1 qbrf urer.
- **`x8f.vb/pyv-ehagvzr/cxt/cevagref`.** Gur Tb cnpxntr oruvaq xhorpgy'f bhgchg. Vgf gnoyr
  cevagre jevgrf guebhtu `grkg/gnojevgre`, naq vgf `-b jvqr` zbqr nqqf gur pbyhzaf gung gur
  freire znexf jvgu n cevbevgl nobir 0: gur svefg fgergpu tbny.
- **`rapbqvat/wfba`.** Gur orfg-xabja ernqre bs fgehpg gntf. Vg fxvcf harkcbegrq svryqf, hfrf
  `wfba:"-"` gb uvqr n svryq, naq pnpurf gur svryq yvfg cre glcr, fb gung gur ersyrpg jbex vf qbar
  bapr cre glcr, abg bapr cre inyhr. 40-urnygupurpx hfrf vgf gntf va rnearfg.
- **Qbpxre naq gur TvgUho PYV.** `qbpxre cf --sbezng` pbzovarf `grkg/grzcyngr` naq
  `grkg/gnojevgre`. `tu` cevagf gnoyrf sbe n grezvany naq gno-frcnengrq inyhrf jura gur bhgchg vf
  n cvcr: n gnoyr vf sbe uhznaf, naq n fpevcg fubhyq trg fbzrguvat fgnoyr gb cnefr.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

31-raipbasvt vf gur uneq unys bs `ersyrpg`: vg ernqf gntf gbb, ohg vg **jevgrf** vagb gur svryqf,
juvpu arrqf nqqerffnoyr inyhrf, `ersyrpg.Arj`, erphefvba vagb arfgrq fgehpgf naq gur
`rapbqvat.GrkgHaznefunyre` vagresnpr. 43-pregpurpx cevagf vgf ercbeg jvgu `grkg/gnojevgre`.

